{
  "schema": 1,
  "goals": [
    "Describe a house, a flat and the rooms",
    "Use ordinal numbers for floors",
    "Say what is where: il y a, il n'y a pas de",
    "Use prepositions of place and contract de + le = du",
    "Talk about chores and conjugate mettre"
  ],
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "fr-6-1",
      "title": "Ma maison",
      "subtitle": "Rooms and floors",
      "topics": ["home"],
      "words": ["home#house", "home#flat, apartment", "home#bedroom", "home#kitchen", "home#living room", "home#bathroom", "home#toilet", "home#dining room", "home#garden", "home#floor, storey", "home#ground floor", "home#stairs", "home#balcony", "home#garage"],
      "learn": [
        {"title": "Where do you live?", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "en": "With a house or a flat you use *dans*: *J'habite dans une maison.* (I live in a house.) *J'habite dans un appartement.* (I live in a flat.)"},
          {"type": "table", "textCols": [0], "rows": [
            ["kitchen", "la cuisine"], ["living room", "le salon"], ["bathroom", "la salle de bains"], ["toilet", "les toilettes"],
            ["dining room", "la salle à manger"], ["bedroom", "la chambre"], ["garden", "le jardin"], ["balcony", "le balcon"], ["garage", "le garage"]
          ]},
          {"type": "tip", "title": "les toilettes", "en": "*Les toilettes* is always plural, even if there's only one toilet."}
        ]},
        {"title": "Floors", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "en": "The ground floor is *le rez-de-chaussée*. Floors are counted with ordinal numbers: *au premier étage* (on the first floor), *au deuxième étage* (on the second floor). You form an ordinal by adding *-ième*: *deux → deuxième, trois → troisième*. Only \"first\" is different: *premier / première*."},
          {"type": "table", "textCols": [0], "rows": [["1.", "premier / première"], ["2.", "deuxième"], ["3.", "troisième"], ["4.", "quatrième"], ["5.", "cinquième"], ["9.", "neuvième"], ["10.", "dixième"]]},
          {"type": "tip", "title": "Spelling", "en": "A final *-e* drops: *quatre → quatrième*. Five adds a *u*: *cinq → cinquième*. Nine changes *f* to *v*: *neuf → neuvième*."},
          {"type": "check", "item": {"type": "cloze", "fr": "J'habite au ___ étage.", "a": ["deuxième"], "hint": "2."}}
        ]},
        {"title": "Words", "blocks": [{"type": "vocab"}]}
      ],
      "practice": [
        {"id": "fr-6-1-01", "type": "cloze", "fr": "J'habite ___ un appartement.", "a": ["dans"]},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-02", "type": "cloze", "fr": "La cuisine est au ___.", "a": ["rez-de-chaussée"], "hint": "ground floor"},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-03", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Ma chambre est au ___ étage.", "a": ["premier"], "hint": "1."},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-04", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Nous habitons au ___ étage.", "a": ["troisième"], "hint": "3."},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-05", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Ma grand-mère habite au ___ étage.", "a": ["cinquième"], "hint": "5."},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-06", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Je mange dans la ___.", "a": ["cuisine"], "hint": "kitchen"},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-07", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Mon père regarde la télé dans le ___.", "a": ["salon"], "hint": "living room"},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-08", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Je me douche dans la ___.", "a": ["salle de bains"], "hint": "bathroom"},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-09", "type": "build", "en": "I live in a house with a garden.", "a": ["J'habite dans une maison avec un jardin."]},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-10", "type": "build", "en": "Our flat is on the fourth floor.", "a": ["Notre appartement est au quatrième étage."]},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-11", "type": "build", "en": "The kitchen is big.", "a": ["La cuisine est grande."]},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-12", "type": "build", "en": "Do you live in a house or a flat? (tu)", "a": ["{Tu habites|Est-ce que tu habites|Habites-tu} dans une maison ou dans un appartement ?"]},
        {"id": "fr-6-1-13", "type": "order", "en": "My bedroom is on the first floor.", "a": ["Ma chambre est au premier étage"], "extra": ["première", "dans"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fr-6-2",
      "title": "Dans ma chambre, il y a...",
      "subtitle": "Il y a and furniture",
      "topics": ["il-y-a", "home"],
      "words": ["home#bed", "home#table", "home#chair", "home#desk", "home#wardrobe", "home#shelf", "home#lamp", "home#rug, carpet", "home#mirror", "home#sofa", "home#window", "home#door"],
      "learn": [
        {"title": "Il y a", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "en": "*Il y a* means \"there is, there are\" and doesn't change with the number: *Dans ma chambre, il y a un lit.* (There's a bed in my room.) *Il y a deux fenêtres.* (There are two windows.)"},
          {"type": "text", "en": "The negative is *il n'y a pas de*: *Il n'y a pas de télé.* (There's no TV.) Questions: *Est-ce qu'il y a un balcon ?* or *Qu'est-ce qu'il y a dans ta chambre ?*"},
          {"type": "examples", "items": [
            {"fr": "Dans le salon, il y a un canapé et une table.", "en": "In the living room there's a sofa and a table."},
            {"fr": "Il n'y a pas de garage.", "en": "There's no garage."},
            {"fr": "Qu'est-ce qu'il y a dans ta chambre ?", "en": "What's in your bedroom?"}
          ]},
          {"type": "check", "item": {"type": "cloze", "fr": "Dans ma chambre, ___ un lit.", "a": ["il y a"], "hint": "there is"}}
        ]},
        {"title": "Furniture", "blocks": [
          {"type": "table", "textCols": [0], "rows": [
            ["bed", "le lit"], ["table", "la table"], ["chair", "la chaise"], ["desk", "le bureau"], ["wardrobe", "l'armoire"],
            ["shelf", "l'étagère"], ["lamp", "la lampe"], ["rug", "le tapis"], ["mirror", "le miroir"], ["sofa", "le canapé"],
            ["window", "la fenêtre"], ["door", "la porte"]
          ]},
          {"type": "tip", "title": "le bureau", "en": "*Le bureau* means both a desk and an office."}
        ]},
        {"title": "Words", "blocks": [{"type": "vocab"}]}
      ],
      "practice": [
        {"id": "fr-6-2-01", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Dans le salon, il y a ___ canapé.", "a": ["un"]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-02", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Il n'y a pas ___ télé.", "a": ["de"]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-03", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Est-ce qu'___ un garage ?", "a": ["il y a"], "hint": "is there"},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-04", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Dans la cuisine, il y a une table et quatre ___.", "a": ["chaises"], "hint": "chair"},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-05", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Il y a deux ___.", "a": ["fenêtres"], "hint": "windows"},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-06", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Dans ma chambre, il y a un ___ et un bureau.", "a": ["lit"], "hint": "bed"},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-07", "type": "build", "en": "In my room there's a bed, a desk and a wardrobe.", "a": ["Dans ma chambre, il y a un lit, un bureau et une armoire."]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-08", "type": "build", "en": "There's no TV in the living room.", "a": ["Dans le salon, il n'y a pas de {télé|télévision}."]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-09", "type": "build", "en": "What's in your bedroom?", "a": ["{Qu'est-ce qu'il y a dans ta chambre|Il y a quoi dans ta chambre} ?"]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-10", "type": "build", "en": "Is there a mirror?", "a": ["{Est-ce qu'il y a un miroir|Il y a un miroir|Y a-t-il un miroir} ?"]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-11", "type": "transform", "task_en": "Make it negative", "fr": "Il y a un garage.", "a": ["Il n'y a pas de garage."]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-12", "type": "transform", "task_en": "Make it negative", "fr": "Il y a des chaises.", "a": ["Il n'y a pas de chaises."]},
        {"id": "fr-6-2-13", "type": "order", "en": "In the kitchen there's a big table.", "a": ["Dans la cuisine il y a une grande table"], "extra": ["grand", "est"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fr-6-3",
      "title": "Où est le chat ?",
      "subtitle": "Prepositions of place",
      "topics": ["prepositions"],
      "words": ["basics#in (inside)", "basics#on (on top of)", "basics#under", "basics#in front of", "basics#behind", "basics#between", "basics#next to", "basics#opposite", "basics#on the left", "basics#on the right", "basics#near", "basics#far"],
      "learn": [
        {"title": "Where is it?", "blocks": [
          {"type": "table", "textCols": [0], "rows": [
            ["in", "dans"], ["on", "sur"], ["under", "sous"], ["in front of", "devant"], ["behind", "derrière"], ["between", "entre"],
            ["next to", "à côté de"], ["opposite", "en face de"], ["to the left of", "à gauche de"], ["to the right of", "à droite de"],
            ["near", "près de"], ["far from", "loin de"]
          ]},
          {"type": "check", "item": {"type": "cloze", "fr": "Le chat est ___ le lit.", "a": ["sous"], "hint": "under"}}
        ]},
        {"title": "à côté du", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "en": "Prepositions ending in *de* contract with *le* and *les*: *de + le = du*, *de + les = des*. *De la* and *de l'* stay as they are."},
          {"type": "table", "rows": [
            ["de + le", "à côté du lit"], ["de + la", "près de la porte"], ["de + l'", "en face de l'armoire"], ["de + les", "à côté des chaises"]
          ]},
          {"type": "examples", "items": [
            {"fr": "La lampe est sur le bureau.", "en": "The lamp is on the desk."},
            {"fr": "Le tapis est devant le canapé.", "en": "The rug is in front of the sofa."},
            {"fr": "J'habite près du collège.", "en": "I live near the school."}
          ]},
          {"type": "check", "item": {"type": "cloze", "fr": "La lampe est à côté ___ lit.", "a": ["du"]}}
        ]},
        {"title": "Words", "blocks": [{"type": "vocab"}]}
      ],
      "practice": [
        {"id": "fr-6-3-01", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Le livre est ___ la table.", "a": ["sur"], "hint": "on"},
